<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's EFU Insurance net 13 pct up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's EFU Insurance net 13 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees).</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	55 vs 59</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	 52 vs 46</p>
<p>    Dividend	     40 pct vs 40 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is EFU General Insurance Ltd. The company said it had transferred 13 million vs 7.0 million to the general reserve. Book closure June 24 to July 1. Ex-dividend date June 24. -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
